body:
Update Open MPI to v5.11.

Update the RDMA network stack:
  - add liburing v2.15, used by the libfabric tcp provider;
  - update xpmem to the latest commit (2026-02-18);
  - update rdma-core to v66.0;
  - update hwloc to v2.16.0;
  - update gdrcopy to v2.7;
  - update libfabric to v2.7.0;
  - update ucx to v1.23.0.

Build updates:
  - the local build of libfabric could pick liburing from the host system; add liburing to cmsdist and let libfabric use the local cms package;
  - the local build of UCX could pick libbfd from the host system; link the static libbfd, libiberty and libsframe built with the cms gcc package.

Fix the GPU perftest:
  - include either the CUDA or ROCm device headers only when building for the corresponding back-end;
  - pass the verbs include path to nvcc so it can find infiniband/mlx5dv.h .

Built and tested locally by Claude Opus 5.5.
